#: ../src/plugins/abrt-action-install-debuginfo.in:190
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage: %s [-vy] [--ids=BUILD_IDS_FILE] [--pkgmgr=(yum|dnf)]\n"
"       [--tmpdir=TMPDIR] [--cache=CACHEDIR[:DEBUGINFODIR1:DEBUGINFODIR2...]] "
"[--size_mb=SIZE]\n"
"       [-e, --exact=PATH[:PATH...]]\n"
"       [--releasever=RELEASEVER] [--repo=PATTERN]\n"
"\n"
"Installs debuginfos for all build-ids listed in BUILD_IDS_FILE\n"
"to CACHEDIR, using TMPDIR as temporary staging area.\n"
"Old files in CACHEDIR are deleted until it is smaller than SIZE.\n"
"\n"
"Reads configuration from /etc/abrt/plugins/CCpp.conf\n"
"\n"
"    -v          Be verbose\n"
"    -y          Noninteractive, assume 'Yes' to all questions\n"
"    --ids       Default: build_ids\n"
"    --tmpdir    Default: @LARGE_DATA_TMP_DIR@/abrt-tmp-debuginfo-"
"RANDOM_SUFFIX\n"
"    --cache     Colon separated list of directories. The first one is used "
"for\n"
"                saving installed debuginfos.\n"
"                Default: /var/cache/abrt-di\n"
"    --size_mb   Default: 4096\n"
"    --pkgmgr    Default: PackageManager from CCpp.conf or 'dnf'\n"
"    -e,--exact  Download only specified files\n"
"    --repo      Pattern to use when searching for repos.\n"
"                Default: *debug*\n"
"    --releasever RELEASEVER\n"
"                Pass this OS version to package managers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana: %s [-vy] [--ids=BUILD_IDS_FAILS] [--pkgmgr=(yum|dnf)]\n"
"       [--tmpdir=PAG_DIR] [--"
"cache=KEŠA_DIR[:DEBUGINFO_DIR1:DEBUGINFO_DIR2...]] [--size_mb=IZMĒRS]\n"
"       [-e, --exact=CEĻŠ[:CEĻŠ...]]\n"
"       [--releasever=LAIDIENS] [--repo=ŠABLONS]\n"
"\n"
"Instalē debuginfo visiem build-id, kas uzskaitīti BUILD_IDS_FAILS,\n"
"uz KEŠA_DIR, izmantojot PAG_DIR kā pagaidu sagatavošanas vietu.\n"
"Vecie faili KEŠA_DIR tiek dzēsti, līdz tā ir mazāka par IZMĒRS.\n"
"\n"
"Nolasa konfigurāciju no /etc/abrt/plugins/CCpp.conf\n"
"\n"
"    -v          Detalizēta izvade\n"
"    -y          Neinteraktīvi, uz visiem jautājumiem pieņemt 'Jā'\n"
"    --ids       Noklusējums: build_ids\n"
"    --tmpdir    Noklusējums: @LARGE_DATA_TMP_DIR@/abrt-tmp-debuginfo-"
"RANDOM_SUFFIX\n"
"    --cache     Ar koliem atdalīts direktoriju saraksts. Pirmā tiek "
"izmantota\n"
"                instalēto debuginfo saglabāšanai.\n"
"                Noklusējums: /var/cache/abrt-di\n"
"    --size_mb   Noklusējums: 4096\n"
"    --pkgmgr    Noklusējums: PackageManager no CCpp.conf vai 'dnf'\n"
"    -e,--exact  Lejupielādēt tikai norādītos failus\n"
"    --repo      Šablons repozitoriju meklēšanai.\n"
"                Noklusējums: *debug*\n"
"    --releasever LAIDIENS\n"
"                Nodot pakotņu pārvaldniekiem šo OS versiju.\n"

